            "type": "text-media",
            "modifiers": ["image", "added-shadow"],
            "heading": "A Scheduler For Professionals",
            "body_html": "<p>Scheduler Pro is our professional scheduling product which supports inter-task dependencies, constraints and working time calendars. It is built with ES2020 &amp; TypeScript and integrates easily into any React, Angular or Vue application.</p>",
            "body_text": "Scheduler Pro is our professional scheduling product which supports inter-task dependencies, constraints and working time calendars. It is built with ES2020 & TypeScript and integrates easily into any React, Angular or Vue application.",
